    <string name="about">About</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer">Cashbook is a manual record-keeping app. It does not connect to any bank, never asks for bank passwords, UPI PINs, card PINs or OTPs, and its reports reflect recorded cash movements only — not a full accrual-based profit and loss account. Consult a qualified professional for tax and statutory matters.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_title">Important</string>
    <string name="about_tagline">A private, offline-first cashbook for recording income, expenses, cash, bank and wallet balances and transfers.</string>
    <string name="about_tech">Technical details</string>
    <string name="about_tech_text">Built with Kotlin and Jetpack Compose. Data is stored only on this device in an encrypted database (SQLCipher, key protected by the Android Keystore). Amounts are stored as whole paise, so there are no rounding errors. Works on Android 8.0 and newer.</string>
